{"page":504,"verses":[{"verse_key":"46:15","surah":46,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَوَصَّيْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ إِحْسَـٰنًا ۖ حَمَلَتْهُ أُمُّهُۥ كُرْهًا وَوَضَعَتْهُ كُرْهًا ۖ وَحَمْلُهُۥ وَفِصَـٰلُهُۥ ثَلَـٰثُونَ شَهْرًا ۚ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا بَلَغَ أَشُدَّهُۥ وَبَلَغَ أَرْبَعِينَ سَنَةً قَالَ رَبِّ أَوْزِعْنِىٓ أَنْ أَشْكُرَ نِعْمَتَكَ ٱلَّتِىٓ أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَىَّ وَعَلَىٰ وَٰلِدَىَّ وَأَنْ أَعْمَلَ صَـٰلِحًا تَرْضَىٰهُ وَأَصْلِحْ لِى فِى ذُرِّيَّتِىٓ ۖ إِنِّى تُبْتُ إِلَيْكَ وَإِنِّى مِنَ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have commanded man to be good to his parents: his mother struggled to carry him and struggled to give birth to him- his bearing and weaning took a full thirty months. When he has grown to manhood and reached the age of forty he [may] say, ‘Lord, help me to be truly grateful for Your favours to me and to my parents; help me to do good work that pleases You; make my offspring good. I turn to You; I am one of those who devote themselves to You.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوَصَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have enjoined","transliteration":"wawaṣṣaynā","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"(on) man","transliteration":"l-insāna","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to his parents","transliteration":"biwālidayhi","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِحْسَـٰنًا ۖ","en_gloss":"kindness","transliteration":"iḥ'sānan","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَمَلَتْهُ","en_gloss":"Carried him","transliteration":"ḥamalathu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُمُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his mother","transliteration":"ummuhu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كُرْهًۭا","en_gloss":"(with) hardship","transliteration":"kur'han","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَوَضَعَتْهُ","en_gloss":"and gave birth to him","transliteration":"wawaḍaʿathu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُرْهًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"(with) hardship","transliteration":"kur'han","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَحَمْلُهُۥ","en_gloss":"And (the) bearing of him","transliteration":"waḥamluhu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَفِصَـٰلُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and (the) weaning of him","transliteration":"wafiṣāluhu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثَلَـٰثُونَ","en_gloss":"(is) thirty","transliteration":"thalāthūna","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"شَهْرًا ۚ","en_gloss":"month(s)","transliteration":"shahran","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَلَغَ","en_gloss":"he reaches","transliteration":"balagha","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَشُدَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his maturity","transliteration":"ashuddahu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَبَلَغَ","en_gloss":"and reaches","transliteration":"wabalagha","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَرْبَعِينَ","en_gloss":"forty","transliteration":"arbaʿīna","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":20,"ar":"سَنَةًۭ","en_gloss":"year(s)","transliteration":"sanatan","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":21,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he says","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":22,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَوْزِعْنِىٓ","en_gloss":"grant me (the) power","transliteration":"awziʿ'nī","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":24,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":25,"ar":"أَشْكُرَ","en_gloss":"I may be grateful","transliteration":"ashkura","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":26,"ar":"نِعْمَتَكَ","en_gloss":"(for) Your favor","transliteration":"niʿ'mataka","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلَّتِىٓ","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":28,"ar":"أَنْعَمْتَ","en_gloss":"You have bestowed","transliteration":"anʿamta","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":29,"ar":"عَلَىَّ","en_gloss":"upon me","transliteration":"ʿalayya","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":30,"ar":"وَعَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"and upon","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":31,"ar":"وَٰلِدَىَّ","en_gloss":"my parents","transliteration":"wālidayya","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":32,"ar":"وَأَنْ","en_gloss":"and that","transliteration":"wa-an","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":33,"ar":"أَعْمَلَ","en_gloss":"I do","transliteration":"aʿmala","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":34,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","en_gloss":"righteous (deeds)","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":35,"ar":"تَرْضَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"which please You","transliteration":"tarḍāhu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":36,"ar":"وَأَصْلِحْ","en_gloss":"and make righteous","transliteration":"wa-aṣliḥ","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":37,"ar":"لِى","en_gloss":"for me","transliteration":"lī","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":38,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":39,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّتِىٓ ۖ","en_gloss":"my offspring","transliteration":"dhurriyyatī","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":40,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"indeed","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":41,"ar":"تُبْتُ","en_gloss":"I turn","transliteration":"tub'tu","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":42,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to You","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":43,"ar":"وَإِنِّى","en_gloss":"and indeed, I am","transliteration":"wa-innī","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":44,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":45,"ar":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"those who submit","transliteration":"l-mus'limīna","verse_key":"46:15"},{"pos":46,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:15"}]},{"verse_key":"46:16","surah":46,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ نَتَقَبَّلُ عَنْهُمْ أَحْسَنَ مَا عَمِلُوا۟ وَنَتَجَاوَزُ عَن سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ فِىٓ أَصْحَـٰبِ ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ وَعْدَ ٱلصِّدْقِ ٱلَّذِى كَانُوا۟ يُوعَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We accept from such people the best of what they do and We overlook their bad deeds. They will be among the people of Paradise- the true promise that has been given to them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) the ones","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَتَقَبَّلُ","en_gloss":"We will accept","transliteration":"nataqabbalu","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"(the) best","transliteration":"aḥsana","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَنَتَجَاوَزُ","en_gloss":"and We will overlook","transliteration":"wanatajāwazu","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their evil deeds","transliteration":"sayyiātihim","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābi","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعْدَ","en_gloss":"A promise","transliteration":"waʿda","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلصِّدْقِ","en_gloss":"true","transliteration":"l-ṣid'qi","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يُوعَدُونَ","en_gloss":"promised","transliteration":"yūʿadūna","verse_key":"46:16"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:16"}]},{"verse_key":"46:17","surah":46,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِى قَالَ لِوَٰلِدَيْهِ أُفٍّ لَّكُمَآ أَتَعِدَانِنِىٓ أَنْ أُخْرَجَ وَقَدْ خَلَتِ ٱلْقُرُونُ مِن قَبْلِى وَهُمَا يَسْتَغِيثَانِ ٱللَّهَ وَيْلَكَ ءَامِنْ إِنَّ وَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ حَقٌّ فَيَقُولُ مَا هَـٰذَآ إِلَّآ أَسَـٰطِيرُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But some say to their parents, ‘What? Are you really warning me that I shall be raised alive from my grave, when so many generations have already passed and gone before me?’ His parents implore God for help; they say, ‘Alas for you! Believe! God’s promise is true,’ but still he replies, ‘These are nothing but ancient fables.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"But the one who","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"says","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to his parents","transliteration":"liwālidayhi","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُفٍّۢ","en_gloss":"Uff","transliteration":"uffin","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَّكُمَآ","en_gloss":"to both of you","transliteration":"lakumā","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَتَعِدَانِنِىٓ","en_gloss":"Do you promise me","transliteration":"ataʿidāninī","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُخْرَجَ","en_gloss":"I will be brought forth","transliteration":"ukh'raja","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَقَدْ","en_gloss":"and have already passed away","transliteration":"waqad","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَلَتِ","en_gloss":"and have already passed away","transliteration":"khalati","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْقُرُونُ","en_gloss":"the generations","transliteration":"l-qurūnu","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before me","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَبْلِى","en_gloss":"before me","transliteration":"qablī","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَهُمَا","en_gloss":"And they both","transliteration":"wahumā","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَسْتَغِيثَانِ","en_gloss":"seek help","transliteration":"yastaghīthāni","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَيْلَكَ","en_gloss":"Woe to you","transliteration":"waylaka","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ءَامِنْ","en_gloss":"Believe","transliteration":"āmin","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَعْدَ","en_gloss":"(the) Promise","transliteration":"waʿda","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":22,"ar":"حَقٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(is) true","transliteration":"ḥaqqun","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"But he says","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":25,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"(is) this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":26,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":27,"ar":"أَسَـٰطِيرُ","en_gloss":"(the) stories","transliteration":"asāṭīru","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the former (people)","transliteration":"l-awalīna","verse_key":"46:17"},{"pos":29,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:17"}]},{"verse_key":"46:18","surah":46,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ حَقَّ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْقَوْلُ فِىٓ أُمَمٍ قَدْ خَلَتْ مِن قَبْلِهِم مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ وَٱلْإِنسِ ۖ إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ خَـٰسِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The verdict has been passed on such people, along with all the communities that went before them, jinn and human: they are lost.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those ","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"46:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) the ones","tra