likullin","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"دَرَجَـٰتٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) degrees","transliteration":"darajātun","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلِيُوَفِّيَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and that He may fully compensate them","transliteration":"waliyuwaffiyahum","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(for) their deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"will not be wronged","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُظْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"will not be wronged","transliteration":"yuẓ'lamūna","verse_key":"46:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:19"}]},{"verse_key":"46:20","surah":46,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ يُعْرَضُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ عَلَى ٱلنَّارِ أَذْهَبْتُمْ طَيِّبَـٰتِكُمْ فِى حَيَاتِكُمُ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱسْتَمْتَعْتُم بِهَا فَٱلْيَوْمَ تُجْزَوْنَ عَذَابَ ٱلْهُونِ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَسْتَكْبِرُونَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ بِغَيْرِ ٱلْحَقِّ وَبِمَا كُنتُمْ تَفْسُقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when those who deny the truth are brought before the Fire, it will be said to them, ‘You squandered the good things you were given in your earthly life, you took your fill of pleasure there, so on this Day a punishment of shame is yours: you were arrogant on earth without any right, and exceeded all limits.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"46:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُعْرَضُ","en_gloss":"will be exposed","transliteration":"yuʿ'raḍu","verse_key":"46:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"46:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve